---
import Tunnel from '../../layouts/Tunnel.astro';
---
<Tunnel title="Critical Protocol | Save My Gig!" status="Critical_Path" red>
  <h1 class="danger" style="margin-bottom:1rem">READ BEFORE STARTING</h1>

  <div class="panel">
    <ul class="checklist">
      <li><strong>You are in control.</strong> You decide every action before it happens.</li>
      <li>Results depend on the hardware state and are <strong>not guaranteed</strong>.</li>
      <li>You can <strong>stop at any time</strong> if you feel uncomfortable with a step.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="panel panel-danger">
    <p style="margin:0">🚨 <strong>Less than 60 minutes before your gig.</strong>
    You don't have time to fix the USB. Right now the goal is simple:
    <strong>play a set.</strong></p>
  </div>

  <p class="question">Do you have access to a computer right now?</p>

  <a href="/protocol/critical/usb-check" class="btn btn-go" data-event="step_completed" data-step="critical_fork_computer" data-answer="yes">
    💻 Yes — I have a computer
  </a>
  <a href="/protocol/critical/no-laptop" class="btn btn-stop" data-event="step_completed" data-step="critical_fork_computer" data-answer="no">
    🚫 No — no computer available
  </a>

  <p style="margin-top:2rem"><a href="/emergency" class="dim" style="text-decoration:none">← Go back</a></p>
</Tunnel>
